	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Siehe <ref target="file12405">Nr. 2358</ref>, Anm. 1.</note>
		<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="2">Ungenügende Ausgabe mit Textänderungen, Fehllesungen und nicht mitgeteilten Auslassungen.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>pacem.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Sex istas tuas, <persName ref="p8440">Gervasi</persName> dilecte, quaestiones<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Nicht erhaltenes Dokument; s. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 584 und Anm. 13.</note> legi et expendi pro mea quidem tenuitate non indiligenter, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>ac re ipsa experior te genus universum dicendi<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">dicendi <hi>von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> aus</hi> docendi <hi>korrigiert.</hi></note> de coena domini mutasse ab eo, quo aliquando utebaris, dum eiusdem greg<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>is<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">gregis <hi>von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">In <placeName ref="l62">Bremgarten</placeName>, zwischen Mai 1529 und November 1531; s. <bibl source="b483">Pestalozzi</bibl> 57. 67.</note> essemus pastores et unius ecclesię doctores.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Valde id me turbat, ac cuperem te rem expendisse diligentius.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Non nescio sic doceri fere a <persName ref="p1974">Luthero</persName>, non nescio verba sic usurpari et torqueri, figi et refigi ab illis, qui <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>videntur sibi mediam tenere sententiam inter Lutheranam et nostram.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego vero existimo pastores ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>doctrinę genus petere debere ab archipastore<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Christus; vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Hebr 13, 20</ref></cit>.</note>, non ex hominibus.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quid ergo me in tuis illis quaestionibus offendat, paucis <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>indicabo non iuste de his disputando sed quaedam duntaxat indicando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z10"/>Deffinitionem coenę legens cogitavi, num animum habueris praesentem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">„Coena“, ais, „est corpus Christi et sanguis <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>eiusdem“, etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Alienissima est hęc finitio a re ipsa<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">a re ipsa <hi>von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>, adeoque et absurda plane!</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Coena est e genere actionum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Actio ergo sacra <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>est a Christo instituta, qua sumpto sacro pane et vino memoriam domini celebramus, gratias ipsi agentes, quod morte <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>innoxia nos liberarit a morte.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sic enim ait dominus: „Hoc facite in mei memoriam.“<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><cit type="bible"><ref>Lk 22, 19</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Et apostolus: „Quoties panem hunc <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>ederitis et poculum biberitis, mortem domini<pb type="edition" next="173"/> annuntiate.“<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 11, 26</ref></cit>.</note></s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Sic usum coenę et finem indicans hominum traditiones sequeris, non simplicem evangelii doctrinam.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Ex ea <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>discimus finem coenę esse memoriam celebrare traditi corporis, gratias agere, sicuti modo dictum est, coalescere in <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>unum corpus (1. Cor. 10 [16f]), exercere fidem in Christum, qui sacramentis institutis testificatur visibiliter et obsignat <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>promissiones evangelii sui (Rom. 4).</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Evangelio autem docemur fide in Christum remitti peccata,<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><cit type="bible"><ref>Eph 1, 7</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Kol 1, 14</ref></cit>.</note> heredes nos fieri vitę <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ęternę,<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><cit type="bible"><ref>Tit 3, 7</ref></cit>.</note> adeoque et Christi et omnium bonorum participes fieri<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kor 9, 8</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>2Thess 1, 11</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Phlm 1, 6</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Hebr 13, 21</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Non tunc demum participamus Christo, cum coena <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>participamus, sed quia participes Christi facti sumus<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><cit type="bible"><ref>Hebr 3, 14</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Ideo accedimus<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">Gemeint ist: accedimus ad mensam domini.</note> apostolo dicente, probet se homo et deinde edat<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 11, 28</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Neque <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>aliter tua possunt intelligi, quam quod in coena et per coenam exhibeantur nobis illa omnia, quae fidelis, priusquam <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>accedat, possidet, et, nisi possideat, ad iudicium accedat (1. Cor. 11 [29]).</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Ex tua doctrina recte sequitur sacramentis <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>conferri sumentibus et non ponentibus obicem gratiam.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Sic aedificamus rursum cum papistis, quod olim destruximus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>cum apostolis.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Ubi nunc generale illud dogma: Fide iustificatur homo absque operibus<note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14"><cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 3, 28</ref></cit>.</note>?</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Iam secundum nostram doctrinam <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>in participatum admittetur et sumptio sacramentorum,<note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15">Zu verstehen ist: Laut unserer Lehre war im Papsttum die Einnahme des Sakraments auch Teil der Lehre von der Beteiligung des Menschen am Heil.</note> quae revera pertinet sub spetiem operum.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Vellem itaque nunc <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sicuti quondam pure et simpliciter diceres, quod scripturis probare posses, quod nullam ansam adversariis <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>papistis suos errores statuendi praeberet: Remissio peccatorum et vita ęterna datur gratuito per Christum <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>credentibus; at Christus testificatur, significat, repraesentat, invocat et obsignat in coena nobis redemptionem suam, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>ac dona nobis collata, quae per fidem possidemus, non in coena demum percipimus.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Acceptabulum<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">= Acetabulum: Gefäß, Saugnäpfchen.</note> salutis fides est, non signum; <ptr target="fnd" type="footnote" n="d"/>coena dom<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>ini signum est<note xml:id="fnd" type="footnote" n="d">Von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> am Rande nachgetragen.</note> et in genere signi manet.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Signum testificatur ac obsignat ac, nisi fides prius adsit et Christus in cordibus <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>habitet, non dat signum quicquam.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">At tu dicis:</foreign> „In disem hochwirdigen sacrament finde man den hunger der <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>seelen ze büßen.“</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la">Aliter Christus Ioannis 4. 6. 7.!</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Dicis: „At coenę tanta non propter coenam <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>et quia opus externum est, sed quia cum fide coniuncta est adeoque et propter fidem, tribuo.“<ptr target="fne" type="footnote" n="e"/></s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Sic papistę operibus propter fidem tribuu<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>nt iustitiam impure<note xml:id="fne" type="footnote" n="e">Vom Abschreiber am Rande ohne Einfügungszeichen nachgetragen, nachdem er die Worte Sic papistae operibus <hi>versehentlich nach</hi> Dicis: "At coenae <hi>abzuschreiben begonnen hatte und dann wieder strich.</hi></note>.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Cur ergo non rite distinguis et iuste agis?</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Iustitia<pb type="edition" next="174"/> suum cuique tribuit<note xml:id="fn17" type="footnote" n="17">Vgl. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl> 1, 2, 15 <hi>(ASD</hi> II/1 228-232, <ref target="file10145">Nr. 115</ref>).</note>.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la">Ita loquere, ne qua sit confusio.</s>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la">Dic: Fidem iustificare nos, <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>sacramenta testari.</s>
					<s n="35" xml:lang="la">Sic Paulus: Abrahamne ante circumcisionem<note xml:id="fnf" type="footnote" n="f">ante circumcisionem <hi>von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>, an post circumcisionem, an per circumcisionem iustificatus est?</s>
					<s n="36" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Respondet: Non per circumcisionem, sed ante accepisse autem circumcisionem signaculum, etc<note xml:id="fn18" type="footnote" n="18">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 4, 1-12</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="37" xml:lang="la">Scis eandem esse rationem <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>sacramentorum.</s>
					<s n="38" xml:lang="la">Ante ergo iustificati sumus, quam coenaremus.</s>
					<s n="39" xml:lang="la">Additur, coena signum adeoque et signaculum iustitię <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>fidei, quae est in coenantibus, etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="40" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Unde, obsecro, probabis neganti aut dubitanti, quod dicis:</s>
					<s n="41" xml:lang="de">Die wort bringent alleß mitt inen?</s>
					<s n="42" xml:lang="la">Sic <persName ref="p1974">Lutherus</persName> dicit<note xml:id="fn19" type="footnote" n="19">Vgl. z.B. <persName ref="p1974">Luthers</persName> "Sermon von dem Sakrament wider die Schwarmgeister" (1526), <bibl source="b671">WA</bibl> XIX 491,13-16.</note>!</s>
					<s n="43" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z41"/>Ab eo hoc accepisti et proposuisti ecclesię tuę.</s>
					<s n="44" xml:lang="la">At certum est verba nihil posse quam significare et significando docere, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>monere, etc.</s>
					<s n="45" xml:lang="la">Nulla verba in ęternum secum ferent, quod significant, nisi placeat incantationi<note xml:id="fng" type="footnote" n="g">ni <hi>in</hi> incantationi <hi>von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> über der Zeile nachgetragen.</hi></note> aliquid tribuere.</s>
					<s n="46" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Valde offendit me hoc dictum tuum temerarium, sed nolo de eo amplius disputare.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="47" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Uteris cum aliis verbo exhibendi, cui nisi adiicias aliam expositionem<note xml:id="fnh" type="footnote" n="h">expositionem <hi>von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> aus</hi> expositiam <hi>korrigiert.</hi></note>, nunquam probabis signa exhibere, quod significant.</s>
					<s n="48" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/>At exhibendi vox adhibetur ut expositio.</s>
					<s n="49" xml:lang="la">Quorsum pertinet expositiones aliis expositionibus illustrare?</s>
					<s n="50" xml:lang="la">Nisi enim dicas „<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>exhibet“, id est „renovat“ aut simile quippiam, quomodo probabis sacramentum exhibere rem significatam, corpus et <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>sanguinem!</s>
					<s n="51" xml:lang="la">Ergo instrumentum et organum est sacramentum, per quod se dominus infundit, aut habent sacramenta, quod s<lb xml:id="p1z48"/>ignificant!</s>
					<s n="52" xml:lang="la">Non enim exhibeo, quod non habeo; exhibeo, quae habeo!</s>
					<s n="53" xml:lang="la">An vero dicemus ministrum exhibere?</s>
					<s n="54" xml:lang="la">Vide, quid de huiusmodi <lb xml:id="p1z49"/>doctoribus dicat <persName ref="p18700">Augustinus</persName> tractatu in Ioannem 5.<note xml:id="fn20" type="footnote" n="20">Denkt <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> vielleicht an Tractatus 18, 10f, über Joh. 5 <hi>(MPL</hi> XXXV 1541-1543)?</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div8" corresp="regest8">
				<p>
					<s n="55" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Cetera nolo excutere diligentius.</s>
					<s n="56" xml:lang="la">Ex his intelligis iuditium meum de tuis 6 quaestionibus, quas ęditas nollem.</s>
					<s n="57" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Ac hortor te, ut apud te cogites, quomodo errori medearis.</s>
					<s n="58" xml:lang="la">Mitto hic libellum<note xml:id="fn21" type="footnote" n="21">Die 1544 entstandene und handschriftlich gebliebene Schrift <persName ref="p8041">a Lascos</persName> "Epitome doctrinae ecclesiae Phrisiae orientalis", von der ein Exemplar in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> erhalten ist (StA, E II 449, Nr. 9, f. 1r.-4[2]v.). Druck in: <hi><persName ref="p8041">A Lasco</persName>, Opera</hi> I XLVII-LIII. - Siehe dazu <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 213f.</note> viri undequaque doctissimi <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>d. <persName ref="p8041">Ioannis a Lasco</persName>, baronis <placeName ref="l2472">Polonię</placeName>, quondam d. <persName ref="p18722">Erasmi Roterodami</persName> moecenatis, qui iam docet in <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l734">Frisia Orientali</placeName> et <placeName ref="l20">Inferiori Germania</placeName> magno cum fructu et accessu fidelium; non quod hominum scriptis nitar, <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>sed ut videas et alios doctiores nobis puritatem doctrinę servare et propugnare, utcunque nonnulli<note xml:id="fni" type="footnote" n="i">In der Vorlage nonulli.</note>, nescio <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>quibus artibus, novum doctrinę genus inculcare multis satagant.</s>
					<s n="59" xml:lang="la">Lectum autem remitte, nam mutuo <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>duntaxat offero.</s>
					<s n="60" xml:lang="la">Scripsit idem <persName ref="p8041">a Lasco</persName> de incarnatione<pb type="edition" next="175"/> domini,<note xml:id="fn22" type="footnote" n="22">Johannes a <hi><persName ref="p8041">Lasco</persName>,</hi> Defensio verae semperque in ecclesia receptae doctrinae de Christi domini incarnatione adversus Mennonem Simonis anabaptistarum doctorem, <placeName ref="l56">Bonn</placeName>, <persName ref="p18192">Laurenz von der Mülen</persName>, 1545 <bibl source="https://gateway-bayern.de/VD16+L+586">(VD16 L586)</bibl>, veröffentlicht in: <hi><persName ref="p8041">A Lasco</persName>, Opera</hi> I 1-62. - Siehe dazu <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 214 und passim.</note> quae tibi utilissima forent contra <persName ref="p8441">Schvenkfeldium</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>de qua re dicet tibi et <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName><note xml:id="fn23" type="footnote" n="23"><persName ref="p8018">Johannes Haller</persName>, der Übermittler dieses Briefes; s. <ref target="file12379">Nr. 2332</ref>, Anm. 19.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div9" corresp="regest9">
				<p>
					<s n="61" xml:lang="la">Is nescit, quod scripsi de causa sacramentaria quicquam ad te.</s>
					<s n="62" xml:lang="la">Soli enim <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>mihi retinui, ac putavi hoc me tibi debere, nec tu cogitabis aliud, quam quod ex charitate hęc omnia <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>proficiscantur.</s>
					<s n="63" xml:lang="la">Amo enim te ex animo ac optime tibi volo, idque hactenus ab annis 14 multis ostendi argumentis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse als Überschrift von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="64" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8440">Gervasio</persName> suo <persName ref="p495">Bul<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>lingerus</persName>.</s>
					<s n="65" xml:lang="la">20. Febr. 1546.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>